# Terraform working dirs + plan artifacts. Provider plugins and cached state
# are machine-local; never commit them.
**/.terraform/
*.tfplan
tfplan

# State files are never committed. The main config's state is REMOTE (S3);
# the bootstrap config's state is LOCAL but stays untracked — this repo is
# public, and state carries the account id + resource ARNs. Bootstrap rarely
# changes and its resources are trivially re-imported if the local file is lost.
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.*

# Do commit the dependency lock files so provider versions are reproducible.
!**/.terraform.lock.hcl
